# Root-level env is not used directly. Each workspace has its own .env.example:
#   backend/.env.example            – API, database, auth, storage, push
#   apps/customer-app/.env.example  – EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   apps/restaurant-app/.env.example– EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   apps/qr-web/.env.example        – NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
#   infrastructure/docker/.env.prod.example – production compose stack
